        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/a/ba8739/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2013-03-02T02:59:45.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Yes -- I use penny sleeves.&nbsp; I used them first to slide in errata sheets for my first edtion cards (minor updates, language consistency, artwork for environments), and then the rest of the expansions got penny sleeved because they were feeling jealous.</p><p>I use UltraPro Sleeves - 2 5/8 x 3 5/8\", and they seem to fit just fine.</p>",
